      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Cluster 1 is a zero-field SMM. χmT at 300 K is 95.51 cm3 K mol−1 (eight uncoupled Dy(III) theoretical 113.36 cm3 K mol−1), falling to 52.84 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization at 2 K saturates near 38.41 Nβ at 11 kOe; M vs H/T curves do not overlay. Hysteresis at 2 K is not obvious. Frequency- and temperature-dependent ac susceptibility under 0 Oe DC field; Cole–Cole α = 0.42–0.63. No χ″ peaks due to QTM; approximate Arrhenius fit gives ΔE/kB ≈ 1.914(0.11) K and τ ≈ 1.77×10−2 s.",
